.465], [676.4879999999999, 352.465], [676.4879999999999, 435.53000000000003], [96.868, 435.53000000000003]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 5, "html": "<p>( 1v ) यदि मुख भूमि और गच्छ दिया हो तो—<br/>“मुखभूमिजोगदले पदगुणिदे पदधनं होदि” ( त्रि सा/१६३ )</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 352.465, 676.4879999999999, 435.53000000000003]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 433.285], [665.372, 433.285], [665.372, 500.635], [96.868, 500.635]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 6, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\frac{\\text{मुख} + \\text{भूमि}}{२} \\times \\text{गच्छ} = \\text{सर्वधन}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 433.285, 665.372, 500.635]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 496.145], [743.1840000000001, 496.145], [743.1840000000001, 639.8249999999999], [96.868, 639.8249999999999]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 7, "html": "<p>( सर्वधन = <math>S_n</math> , गच्छ = <math>n</math> ; मुख = <math>T_1</math> ; भूमि = <math>T_n</math> ; चय = <math>d</math> )<br/>तो <math>S_n - T_1 + (T_1 + d) + (T_1 + 2d) + (T_1 + 3d) + (T_n - 3d) + (T_n - 2d) + (T_n - d) + T_n</math></p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 496.145, 743.1840000000001, 639.8249999999999]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 642.0699999999999], [749.536, 642.0699999999999], [749.536, 796.9749999999999], [96.868, 796.9749999999999]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 8, "html": "<math display=\"block\">2S_n = \\overline{T_1 + T_n} + \\overline{T_1 + T_n + T_1 + T_n + \\overline{T_1 + T_n}} \\\\ \\cdots \\overline{T_1 + T_n + \\overline{T_1 + T_n + \\overline{T_1 + T_n}} + \\overline{T_1 + T_n} \\\\ = n(T_1 + T_n) .</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 642.0699999999999, 749.536, 796.9749999999999]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 801.4649999999999], [547.86, 801.4649999999999], [547.86, 884.5300000000001], [96.868, 884.5300000000001]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 9, "html": "<math display=\"block\">S_n = \\frac{T_1 + T_n}{2} \\quad n = \\frac{\\text{मुख} + \\text{भूमि}}{2} \\times \\text{गच्छ} ।</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 801.4649999999999, 547.86, 884.5300000000001]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 913.7149999999999], [317.6, 913.7149999999999], [317.6, 956.37], [96.868, 956.37]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 10, "html": "<p>( १ ) गच्छ निकालो</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 913.7149999999999, 317.6, 956.37]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 974.33], [730.48, 974.33], [730.48, 1126.99], [96.868, 1126.99]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 11, "html": "<p>( i ) यदि मुख भूमि और चय दिया हो तो<br/>“आदी अंते सुद्धे नच्छिहिदे इगिजुदे ठाणा । ( त्रि.सा/१७ )”<br/>भूमि - मुख <math>\\frac{T_n - T_1}{\\text{चय}} + १ = \\frac{T_n - T_1}{d} + 1 = \\text{गच्छ} ( n )</math></p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 974.33, 730.48, 1126.99]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 1156.175], [304.896, 1156.175], [304.896, 1196.585], [96.868, 1196.585]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 12, "html": "<p>( २ ) चय निकालो</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 1156.175, 304.896, 1196.585]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 1205.565], [698.72, 1205.565], [698.72, 1358.225], [96.868, 1358.225]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 13, "html": "<p>( 1 ) यदि गच्छ और सर्वधन दिया हो तो<br/>“पदकदिसंखेण भाजियं पचयं ।” ( गो.जी./भाषा/४६/१२३ )<br/>सर्वधन <math>\\frac{\\text{सर्वधन}}{\\text{गच्छ}} = \\text{संस्थात} = \\text{चय} ( d )</math></p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 1205.565, 698.72, 1358.225]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 1358.225], [747.948, 1358.225], [747.948, 1470.4750000000001], [96.868, 1470.4750000000001]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 14, "html": "<p>( 2 ) यदि सर्वधन, आदिधन व गच्छ दिया हो तो<br/>“आदिधनोन गुणितं पदोनपदकृतिदलेन सभाजतं पचयं ( गो. जी./भाषा/४६/१२३ )</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 1358.225, 747.948, 1470.4750000000001]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 1486.19], [589.148, 1486.19], [589.148, 1555.7849999999999], [96.868, 1555.7849999999999]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 15, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(\\text{सर्वधन} - \\text{आदिधन}) = \\frac{\\text{गच्छ}^2 - \\text{गच्छ}}{2} = \\text{चय} (d)</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 1486.19, 589.148, 1555.7849999999999]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 1562.52], [730.48, 1562.52], [730.48, 1614.155], [96.868, 1614.155]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 16, "html": "<math display=\"block\">(\\text{सर्वधन} = S_n; \\text{मुख} = T_1; \\text{भूमि} = T_n; \\text{गच्छ} = n; \\text{चय} = d)</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 1562.52, 730.48, 1614.155]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 1616.3999999999999], [749.536, 1616.3999999999999], [749.536, 1766.815], [96.868, 1766.815]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 17, "html": "<math display=\"block\">S_n = \\frac{T_1 + T_n}{2} \\times^n = \\frac{n\\{T_1 + T_1 + d(n-1)\\}}{2} \\\\ = \\frac{n.2T_1 + n(n-1)d}{2}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 1616.3999999999999, 749.536, 1766.815]}, {"polygon": [[144.508, 1782.5300000000002], [703.484, 1782.5300000000002], [703.484, 1881.31], [144.508, 1881.31]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 18, "html": "<math display=\"block\">= \\frac{2nT_1 + (n^2 - n)d}{2} \\quad \\therefore \\frac{2(S_n - nT_1)}{n^2 - n/2} = d</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [144.508, 1782.5300000000002, 703.484, 1881.31]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 1879.0649999999998], [571.68, 1879.0649999999998], [571.68, 1921.72], [96.868, 1921.72]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 19, "html": "<p>( 11 ) यदि सर्वधन, मुख व गच्छ दिया हो तो—</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 1879.0649999999998, 571.68, 1921.72]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 1919.475], [662.196, 1919.475], [662.196, 2000.295], [96.868, 2000.295]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 20, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\left\\{ \\frac{\\text{सर्वधन}}{\\text{गच्छ}} - \\text{मुख} \\right\\} \\div \\frac{\\text{गच्छ} - १}{2} = \\text{चय}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 1919.475, 662.196, 2000.295]}, {"polygon": [[96.868, 2004.785], [431.93600000000004, 2004.785], [431.93600000000004, 2081.1150000000002], [96.868, 2081.1150000000002]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 21, "html": "<math display=\"block\">\\left( -\\frac{S_n - T_1}{n} \\right) \\div \\frac{n-1}{2} = d</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [96.868, 2004.785, 431.93600000000004, 2081.1150000000002]}, {"polygon": [[820.996, 148.17000000000002], [1102.072, 148.17000000000002], [1102.072, 197.56], [820.996, 197.56]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 22, "html": "<p>( ४ ) मुख या आदि निकालो</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [820.996, 148.17000000000002, 1102.072, 197.56]}, {"polygon": [[820.996, 202.04999999999998], [1252.932, 202.04999999999998], [1252.932, 242.46], [820.996, 242.46]], "confidence": 0.973256562