ror": false, "bbox": [820.996, 1389.655, 1157.652, 1434.555]}, {"polygon": [[820.996, 1441.29], [1487.9560000000001, 1441.29], [1487.9560000000001, 1627.625], [820.996, 1627.625]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 39, "html": "<p>अंतधनं गुणगुणियं आदिविहीणं रुक्णुत्तरपदभजियं = गुणकार करतां अंतविषैं जो प्रमाण होइ ताकी जितनेका गुणकार होइ ताकरि गुणिए, तिस बिषै पहिले जितना प्रमाण होइ सो घटाइए । जो प्रमाण होइ ताको एकघाटि गुणकारका .भाग दीजिये । यो करता जो प्रमाण होइ सो ही गुणकार रूप सर्व स्थाननिका जोड जानना ।</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [820.996, 1441.29, 1487.9560000000001, 1627.625]}, {"polygon": [[820.996, 1627.625], [1035.376, 1627.625], [1035.376, 1683.75], [820.996, 1683.75]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 40, "html": "<math display=\"block\">T_n = T_1 \\times r^{n-1}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [820.996, 1627.625, 1035.376, 1683.75]}, {"polygon": [[820.996, 1683.75], [1395.852, 1683.75], [1395.852, 1762.325], [820.996, 1762.325]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 41, "html": "<math display=\"block\">S_n = \\frac{T_1 (1-r^n)}{1-r} \\text{ or } \\frac{T_1 (n^n - 1)}{r-1} \\text{ । यथा—}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [820.996, 1683.75, 1395.852, 1762.325]}, {"polygon": [[820.996, 1764.5700000000002], [1252.932, 1764.5700000000002], [1252.932, 1813.96], [820.996, 1813.96]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 42, "html": "<math display=\"block\">S_n = a + ar + ar^2 + ar^3 \\cdot ar^{n-1}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [820.996, 1764.5700000000002, 1252.932, 1813.96]}, {"polygon": [[820.996, 1816.2050000000002], [1408.556, 1816.2050000000002], [1408.556, 1867.84], [820.996, 1867.84]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 43, "html": "<math display=\"block\">r. S_n = ar + ar^2 + ar^3 + ar^4 \\cdots ar^{n-1} + a</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [820.996, 1816.2050000000002, 1408.556, 1867.84]}, {"polygon": [[820.996, 1867.84], [1090.9560000000001, 1867.84], [1090.9560000000001, 1917.23], [820.996, 1917.23]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 44, "html": "<math display=\"block\">S_n - r. S_n = a - ar^n</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [820.996, 1867.84, 1090.9560000000001, 1917.23]}, {"polygon": [[820.996, 1921.72], [1140.184, 1921.72], [1140.184, 1975.6], [820.996, 1975.6]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 45, "html": "<math display=\"block\">S_n (1-r) = a (1-r^n)</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [820.996, 1921.72, 1140.184, 1975.6]}, {"polygon": [[820.996, 1971.11], [1270.4, 1971.11], [1270.4, 2054.175], [820.996, 2054.175]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Equation", "raw_label": "Equation-Block", "reading_order": 46, "html": "<math display=\"block\">S_n = \\frac{a(1-r^n)}{1-r} = \\frac{T_1(1-r^n)}{1-r}</math>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [820.996, 1971.11, 1270.4, 2054.175]}, {"polygon": [[820.996, 2051.9300000000003], [1306.924, 2051.9300000000003], [1306.924, 2094.585], [820.996, 2094.585]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "Text", "raw_label": "Text", "reading_order": 47, "html": "<p>Where <math>a = T_1</math> = मुख ; <math>r</math> = गुणाकार</p>", "skipped": false, "error": false, "bbox": [820.996, 2051.9300000000003, 1306.924, 2094.585]}, {"polygon": [[654.256, 2117.035], [890.868, 2117.035], [890.868, 2164.18], [654.256, 2164.18]], "confidence": 0.9732565621543934, "label": "PageFooter", "raw_label": "Page-Footer", "reading_order": 48, "html": "<p>जैनेन्द्र सिद्धान्त कोश</p>", "skipped": fa